:''This article is about the enemy. For the Cat Unit, see [[Aura (Super Rare Cat)]].''
'''Aura''' (アウラ ''Aura'') is a [[:Category:Traitless Enemies|Traitless]] enemy that appears in the [[Merc Storia Collaboration Event]]. She was added in [[Version 2.2 Update#Version 2.2.9 Update|Version 2.2.9]].

{{Enemy Info
|name = Aura
|image = E 095.png
|appearance = [[Merc Storia Collaboration Event]]
|money drop = 800¢ - 3160¢
}}

==Enemy==
She shares similarities with both [[Fuu (Enemy)|Fuu]] and [[The Face]], but without the [[:Category:Floating Enemies|Floating]] trait. She has high HP, high damage per hit, stands at a fairly good range, moves very slowly, and knocks back cats that survive her attacks. However, her backswing is quite long, so on her own she won't push at all, though her supports make up for her lack of pushing power.

